    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Xisqiyaah Wuxuu U Dabbaaldegay Iiddii Kormaridda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Xisqiyaah u cid diray dadka Israa'iil oo dhan iyo dadka Yahuudah, oo haddana wuxuu warqado u qoray reer Efrayim iyo reer Manaseh, inay dhammaantood wada yimaadaan guriga Rabbiga oo Yeruusaalem ku yaal, si ay Iiddii Kormaridda ugu sameeyaan Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, boqorka, iyo amiirradiisii, iyo shirkii Yeruusaalem joogay oo dhammu waxay ku arrinsadeen inay Iiddii Kormaridda sameeyaan bishii labaad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maxaa yeelay, iyagu wakhtigaas ma ay samayn karin, waayo, wadaaddadii tiro hawsha ku filanu isma ay daahirin, oo dadkiina Yeruusaalem kuma ay soo wada ururin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaasuna wuu la qummanaa boqorkii iyo shirkii oo dhanba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed waxay amar ku soo saareen in lagu naadiyo dalka reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan, tan iyo Bi'ir Shebac iyo ilaa Daan, inay wada yimaadaan oo ay Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil Iidda Kormaridda Yeruusaalem ugu sameeyaan, waayo, wakhti dheer looma samayn sida qoran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed niman wargeeys ah ayaa boqorkii iyo amiirradiisii ka qaadeen warqadihii, waxayna dhex marsiiyeen dalka Israa'iil iyo dalka Yahuudah oo dhan, waxayna ku socdeen si waafaqsan boqorka amarkiisii, iyagoo leh, Reer binu Israa'iilow, mar kale ku soo noqda Rabbiga ah Ilaaha Ibraahim iyo Isxaaq iyo Israa'iil, inuu isagu ku soo jeedsado kuwiinna ka baxsaday gacantii boqorradii Ashuur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo idinku ha noqonina sidii awowayaashiin oo kale, iyo sidii walaalihiin oo kale, kuwaasoo ku xadgudbay Rabbiga ah Ilaahii awowayaashood, oo uu isna taas aawadeed iyagii ka dhigay wax laga yaabo, sida aad idinkuba u aragtaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba sidii awowayaashiin ahaan jireen, idinkuna ha noqonina dad madax adag, laakiinse idinku Rabbiga isu dhiiba, oo gala meeshiisa quduuska ah oo uu weligiisba quduus ka dhigay, oo u adeega Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah, si cadhadiisa kululi ay idiinka noqoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, haddaad Rabbiga u soo noqotaan, walaalihiin iyo carruurtiinniiba waxay naxariis ka heli doonaan kuwii iyaga maxaabiis ahaanta u kaxaystay, oo iyana mar kalay dalkan ku soo noqon doonaan, maxaa yeelay, Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ahu waa roonaan badan yahay, waana naxariis miidhan, oo wejigiisana idinka sii jeedin maayo haddaad isaga u soo noqotaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed nimankii wargeeyska ahaa magaaloba magaalay u sii dhex mareen dalkii reer Efrayim iyo kii reer Manaseh oo dhan, iyo xataa ilaa kii reer Sebulun, laakiinse iyaga waa lagu qoslay, waana lagu majaajilooday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee qaar ah reer Aasheer iyo reer Manaseh iyo reer Sebulun ayaa is-hoosaysiiyey oo Yeruusaalem yimid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba dadka Yahuudahna waxaa la jirtay Rabbiga gacantiisii inay isku qalbi ahaadaan oo ay sameeyaan amarkii boqorka iyo kii amiirradiisa oo ahaa Eraygii Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba bishii labaad waxaa Yeruusaalem ku soo shiray oo Iiddii Kibista-aan-khamiirka-lahayn sameeyey dad badan oo ah shir aad iyo aad u weyn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay kaceen oo waxay fogeeyeen meelihii allabariga oo Yeruusaalem dhex yiil iyo girgirayaashii fooxa lagu shidi jiray oo dhan, oo dhammaantood waxay ku dhex tuureen durdurkii Qidroon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay neefafkii Iiddii Kormaridda qaleen bishii labaad maalinteedii afar iyo tobnaad, oo wadaaddadii iyo kuwii reer Laawina way yaxyaxeen, oo intay isdaahiriyeen ayay qurbaanno la gubo keeneen gurigii Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay meeshoodii istaageen sidii loogu amray sharcigii Muuse oo ahaa ninkii Ilaah, oo wadaaddadu waxay saydhsaydhi jireen dhiiggii ay ka guddoomeen gacantii reer Laawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa jiray kuwo badan oo shirka ka mid ahaa oo aan isdaahirin, sidaas daraaddeed reer Laawi shuqulkoodu wuxuu ahaa inay neefafka Kormaridda u gowracaan mid alla midkii aan nadiif ahayn, si ay iyaga Rabbiga ugu daahiriyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maxaa yeelay, dad badan, xataa kuwa badan oo ahaa reer Efrayim iyo reer Manaseh iyo reer Isaakaar iyo reer Sebulun ayan isnadiifin oo weliba waxay wax uga cuneen neefafka Kormaridda si ka duwan sidii qornayd. Waayo, Xisqiyaah ayaa iyaga u duceeyey oo yidhi, Rabbiga wanaagsanu ha cafiyo ku alla kii ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qalbigiisa u diyaariya inuu doondoono Ilaaha ah Rabbiga oo ah Ilaahii awowayaashiis in kastoo uusan isu nadiifin sidii ay ahayd isdaahirintii meesha quduuska ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbiguna wuu maqlay Xisqiyaah, dadkiina wuu bogsiiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer binu Israa'iil ee Yeruusaalem joogayna intii toddoba maalmood ah ayay iidayeen Iiddii Kibista-aan-khamiirka-lahayn, iyagoo aad u faraxsan, oo kuwii reer Laawi iyo wadaaddadiina maalin kasta ayay Rabbiga ammaani jireen, iyagoo Rabbiga ugu gabyaya alaab muusiko oo dhawaaq dheer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Xisqiyaahna wuxuu dhiirrigeliyey kuwii reer Laawi oo hawsha Rabbiga aad u yiqiin. Oo toddobadii maalmood ee iiddu socotayba wax bay cunayeen, iyagoo qurbaanno nabaadiino bixinaya, oo Rabbiga ah Ilaahii awowayaashood u mahad naqaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo shirkii oo dhammuna waxay ku tashadeen inay toddoba maalmood oo kale sii iidaan, oo haddana toddoba maalmood oo kale ayay sii iidayeen iyagoo faraxsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Xisqiyaah oo ahaa boqorkii dalka Yahuudah wuxuu shirkii u siiyey inay qurbaan ka dhigtaan kun dibi iyo toddoba kun oo ido ah, oo amiirradiina waxay shirkii siiyeen kun dibi iyo toban kun oo ido ah, oo wadaaddo tiro badanuna way isdaahiriyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo shirkii dadkii Yahuudah oo dhan iyo wadaaddadii iyo kuwii reer Laawi, iyo shirkii dalka Israa'iil ka yimid oo dhan, iyo shisheeyayaashii dalka Israa'iil ka yimid oo dalka Yahuudah degganaaba way wada reyreeyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yeruusaalem waxaa jirtay farxad weyn, waayo, taasoo kale kama ay dhicin Yeruusaalem tan iyo wakhtigii Sulaymaan ina Daa'uud uu boqor dalka Israa'iil ka ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa wadaaddadii reer Laawi ahaa kaceen oo dadkii u duceeyeen, oo codkoodiina waa la maqlay, oo baryootankoodii wuxuu soo gaadhay samada ee ah Rabbiga rugtiisa quduuska ah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
